Alembic baseline for the existing MySQL schema.

`0001_baseline` is an empty revision. It gives Alembic a starting point for a database whose tables
were created by the Node/Sequelize backend. The live database has been stamped with this revision;
`alembic_version` contains `0001_baseline`.

Future schema changes must be new revisions. Never run `alembic revision --autogenerate` to create
an initial "create all tables" migration, and never downgrade/reset production. See
SCHEMA_MAPPING.md for the inspection and stamp record.
